          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Mental Model",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "DataFrame = ==typed column arrays== (NumPy or Arrow-backed)",
                "Memory = ==rows x dtype width== per column",
                "So {orange:dtype choice} is the main lever",
                "Wasteful defaults: `int64`, `float64`, `object`",
                "pandas 3 infers `str` for text; `object` is the older default",
                "5 repeated labels still store ==every string=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Shallow vs Deep",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Call",
                "String column counted as"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`memory_usage()` on `object`",
                  "8-byte pointers only: {red:wrong}"
                ],
                [
                  "`memory_usage()` on `str` + pyarrow",
                  "real buffer bytes"
                ],
                [
                  "`memory_usage()` on `str`, no pyarrow",
                  "pointers only (Python storage)"
                ],
                [
                  "`memory_usage(deep=True)`",
                  "real string bytes: {green:trust it}"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`df.info(memory_usage='deep')` gives the same deep numbers",
                "Measure with deep ==before== optimising"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Workflow",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Measure",
                    "sub": "deep=True",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Pick dtype",
                    "sub": "per column",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "x",
                    "text": "Convert",
                    "sub": "astype",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Re-measure",
                    "sub": "compare",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Top offender: `df.memory_usage(deep=True).sort_values(ascending=False)`",
